{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>להזדה</b> — a way of arrogance." "<b>And the meaning of וכל ארחתך ליה</b> — that you are in His hand, and He leads you wherever He wills, like a horse's bit in the rider's hand. And Yefet said: ובאחריתך תלך אליו על דרך — 'and at your end you go to Him by way of: <i>and the spirit returns to the Elohim who gave it</i> [Ecclesiastes 12:7].'"], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:03.645193985Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}